## WHY
Physical Home feedback shows the split advertisement is useful but still reads like a floating picture-in-picture card. Wide creatives are hard-cropped into the narrow panel and campaigns currently have no rendered QR destination.

## SCOPE
Advertising presentation + Ads admin/data projection only.

### Home integration
- the split placement becomes a structural right rail, flush with the Home composition rather than a detached card;
- the decorative 2.5D station yields its right-side visual slot while Ads is active;
- the canonical decision/payment surfaces reserve the same rail width;
- the visible Home rail is clamped to 32–46% so the former 25% campaign is slightly larger without taking over the customer controls.

### Automatic media adaptation
- media width/height is now included in the read-only playlist projection;
- wide image creatives automatically switch to an adaptive rendering: full source preserved with a blurred full-bleed extension instead of a destructive center crop;
- no second paid image-processing service and no extra stored derivative are introduced.

### QR
- campaigns gain an optional HTTPS `qr_url`;
- Ads admin can configure it;
- a generated QR is rendered automatically on the Home rail and fullscreen screensaver;
- the QR does not grant kiosk/rental authority and is not used as a backend credential.

## PROTECTED CORE
No pricing, Stripe, rental/session, ejection, return, slot mapping, inventory, kiosk auth or hardware-command changes. Ads failure remains isolated from rental.

## DATABASE
One nullable Advertising-only column (`advertising_campaigns.qr_url`) with HTTPS constraint. No destructive migration.

## VALIDATION REQUIRED
- Chargeurs Ads CI: regression tests, targeted lint and production build;
- stage the nullable migration and Ads Edge functions only after code review/CI;
- physical 1280×720 check on DTA21269: rail feels integrated, Express/Client remain reachable, current landscape Makas-style creatives remain legible, QR scans at normal standing distance, screensaver synchronization remains unchanged.

## COST
Uses existing `qrcode.react`, CSS/DOM rendering and current Supabase storage. No new dependency, hosted service or paid image-processing pipeline.

## Publicação autorizada

- remove o cabeçalho grande do Inbox WhatsApp da loja;
- transforma os indicadores em uma faixa horizontal compacta no topo;
- ajusta a altura do cockpit para manter o campo de mensagem e ações comerciais visíveis na abertura;
- mantém rolagem principal no histórico da conversa;
